Request Flow(Registeration)

Now let's follow one request.

User sends

{
    "email":"damisa@gmail.com",
    "username":"damisa",
    "password":"123456",
    "confirm_password":"123456"
}

↓

View receives request.

↓

View calls serializer.

↓

Serializer validates.

↓

Serializer calls service.

↓

Service opens transaction.

↓

Service creates user.

↓

Service assigns Customer role.

↓

Service returns user.

↓

Serializer returns user.

↓

View sends HTTP Response.

That's the entire architecture.



